! XRT-10 RT01(IOL 17.15・据付・変更しない)= XRT-09 と同じ P ルータ(BGP なし)に SR の準備を足したもの。
! SR= SRGB 既定(16000-23999)・Lo0 の index 11・SR のラベルを優先(sr-label-preferred)・TI-LFA・Flex-Algo 128 に参加(定義は持たない・index 1xx= 読み物の「やってみる」用)。IOS どうしの LDP は残す。
! XR01 向きの IF= LDP の同期を外してある(XR01 が LDP を止めても最大メトリックにしない= 移行の準備)・BFD(100 ms × 3)。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
mpls ldp discovery targeted-hello accept
!
segment-routing mpls
 !
 set-attributes
  address-family ipv4
   sr-label-preferred
  exit-address-family
 !
 connected-prefix-sid-map
  address-family ipv4
   10.255.0.11/32 index 11 range 1
  exit-address-family
 !
  address-family ipv4 algorithm 128
   10.255.0.11/32 index 111 range 1
  exit-address-family
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.11 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description PRIMARY to XR01
 ip address 10.0.1.11 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 10
 mpls ip
 no mpls ldp igp sync
 bfd interval 100 min_rx 100 multiplier 3
 isis bfd
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description CORE-A to RT02
 ip address 10.0.12.11 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 10
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0011.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 segment-routing mpls
 fast-reroute per-prefix level-2 all
 fast-reroute ti-lfa level-2
 flex-algo 128
 log-adjacency-changes
 mpls ldp sync
!
